    "summary": "Costs 1 CP. At either player’s [Command phase](vsdata:core-rule/command-phase) opening, choose a friendly unit with **ORDO MALLEUS**, **INQUISITOR** or **INQUISITORIAL AGENTS**. Ward a marker you control if the chosen unit is in its [objective](vsdata:core-rule/objectives) range. The ward keeps the marker yours without any models nearby. It expires when the opponent holds the marker at turn end. Opposing units with **DAEMON** are barred from setting up 6 inches or closer to the warded marker.",
